{"title":"Wind Energy Engineer Roadmap","role":"Wind Energy Engineer","summary":"A Wind Energy Engineer works on the technical planning, design, development, installation, operation, performance optimization, and maintenance of wind-energy systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Energy / Renewable Energy Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Wind Energy Engineer works on the technical planning, design, development, installation, operation, performance optimization, and maintenance of wind-energy systems."},{"type":"p","text":"The career combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable energy engineering"},{"text":"Wind resource assessment"},{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"Turbine technology"},{"text":"Electrical systems"},{"text":"Mechanical systems"},{"text":"Structural engineering"},{"text":"Power systems"},{"text":"Energy forecasting"},{"text":"SCADA and condition monitoring"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Project development"},{"text":"Environmental and site assessment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Wind engineers can work across onshore wind farms, offshore wind projects, turbine manufacturing, renewable-energy developers, EPC companies, utilities, engineering consultancies, and energy analytics organizations."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build renewable-energy, wind-resource, electrical/mechanical and data-analysis fundamentals; enter as Wind Energy Engineer, Renewable Energy Engineer or Wind Analyst."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Progress toward Wind Resource Engineer, Performance Engineer, Operations Engineer, SCADA Engineer or Wind Farm Engineer."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Move into Lead Engineer, Wind Farm Engineering Manager, Asset Performance Manager or R